        "segments": [
          {
            "title": "",
            "content": "下面我们分两步来解决这道题。",
            "subtitles": [
              {
                "text": "好，我们先来解决第一个问题，求参数M的值。",
                "audio": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/eduvideo/education-ai/users/0c775bb2-6aae-4ad1-b8a1-4575dc2191ae/100caabc-2120-42b6-bcf3-0ab88b270715/question_explanation_video_gen_script_2f6db485-3f5b-47a3-80b0-20c802ded697_readable_tts_87460679-1f17-4fd2-8dea-7c63bfbb90a0.mp3",
                "duration": 4300
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "第一空：求解参数m",
            "content": "对于椭圆 $E: \\frac{x^2}{10} + \\frac{y^2}{m} = 1$，有：$a^2 = 10, b^2 = m \\implies c^2 = a^2 - b^2 = 10 - m$离心率 $e^2 = \\frac{c^2}{a^2} = \\frac{10-m}{10}$",
            "subtitles": [
              {
                "text": "首先根据椭圆的标准方程，我们写出A平方、B平方和C平方的表达式，进而得到离心率的平方与M的关系式。",
                "audio": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/eduvideo/education-ai/users/0c775bb2-6aae-4ad1-b8a1-4575dc2191ae/100caabc-2120-42b6-bcf3-0ab88b270715/question_explanation_video_gen_script_2f6db485-3f5b-47a3-80b0-20c802ded697_readable_tts_963e8769-5fa7-4c9b-bd73-05627a58a7cf.mp3",
                "duration": 10194
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "利用“黄金椭圆”定义建立等式",
            "content": "根据定义，$e = \\frac{\\sqrt{5} - 1}{2}$，则$e^2 = (\\frac{\\sqrt{5} - 1}{2})^2 = \\frac{6 - 2\\sqrt{5}}{4} = \\frac{3 - \\sqrt{5}}{2}$所以，$\\frac{10-m}{10} = \\frac{3 - \\sqrt{5}}{2}$",
            "subtitles": [
              {
                "text": "然后，我们利用题目给的“黄金椭圆”的定义，计算出这个特殊离心率的平方。",
                "audio": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/eduvideo/education-ai/users/0c775bb2-6aae-4ad1-b8a1-4575dc2191ae/100caabc-2120-42b6-bcf3-0ab88b270715/question_explanation_video_gen_script_2f6db485-3f5b-47a3-80b0-20c802ded697_readable_tts_ef535812-77c4-4f91-b405-b985f3fff20c.mp3",
                "duration": 6049
              },
              {
                "text": "这样我们就得到了一个关于M的方程。",
                "audio": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/eduvideo/education-ai/users/0c775bb2-6aae-4ad1-b8a1-4575dc2191ae/100caabc-2120-42b6-bcf3-0ab88b270715/question_explanation_video_gen_script_2f6db485-3f5b-47a3-80b0-20c802ded697_readable_tts_3e15055a-728c-497e-9eb0-56b46bba3da0.mp3",
                "duration": 2856
              }
