                "duration": 7700
              },
              {
                "text": "这样一来，问题就豁然开朗了，这个比值就是离心率的倒数。",
                "audio": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/eduvideo/education-ai/users/0c775bb2-6aae-4ad1-b8a1-4575dc2191ae/100caabc-2120-42b6-bcf3-0ab88b270715/question_explanation_video_gen_script_2f6db485-3f5b-47a3-80b0-20c802ded697_readable_tts_8a37db7c-f413-45fa-a036-0aec3c2b5058.mp3",
                "duration": 5500
