          },
          {
            "title": "代入“黄金椭圆”离心率求解",
            "content": "$\\frac{|PM|}{|MN|} = \\frac{1}{\\frac{\\sqrt{5}-1}{2}} = \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}-1} = \\frac{2(\\sqrt{5}+1)}{(\\sqrt{5}-1)(\\sqrt{5}+1)} = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}+1}{2}$",
            "subtitles": [
              {
                "text": "题目已经指明这是黄金椭圆，我们代入给定的离心率，然后对分母进行有理化，就能得到最终结果。",
                "audio": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/eduvideo/education-ai/users/0c775bb2-6aae-4ad1-b8a1-4575dc2191ae/100caabc-2120-42b6-bcf3-0ab88b270715/question_explanation_video_gen_script_2f6db485-3f5b-47a3-80b0-20c802ded697_readable_tts_4c912998-f3df-475b-a027-395cd794a96c.mp3",
